    "description": "How a unified booking engine, CRM pipeline, itinerary builder and AI assistant cut tool-switching for travel agents.",
    "url": "https://abdulazizabudhair-portfolio.vercel.app/work/vbooking-turbo-suite",
    "image": "https://abdulazizabudhair-portfolio.vercel.app/assets/img/og-turbo-suite.jpg",
    "author": {
